# Healthcare Claims Dashboard (Databricks)

This dashboard tracks healthcare claims data to provide actionable insights for health centers.

## Key Features
- Monthly claim volume and cost trends
- Cost breakdown by medical category, provider, and place of service
- High-cost and low-cost member identification
- PMPM (Per Member Per Month) and ER visit trends

